  A1      proved     pred_met=True  neutral k = mu: haploid N mu * 1/N and diploid 2N mu * 1/(2N)
  A2      proved     pred_met=True  neutral P_fix = initial frequency i/M (martingale; exact WF chains)
  A3      confirmed  pred_met=True  P_fix independent of N_e in an exchangeable low-N_e Cannings chain; time scales with N_e
  A4      proved     pred_met=True  start state: stationary past gives k = mu exactly; empty start gives deficit -> mu E[tau]
  B1      proved     pred_met=True  Kimura u(p) solves the backward equation with u(0)=0, u(1)=1
  B2      proved     pred_met=True  Kimura limits: s->0 gives p; N->inf at p=1/(2N) gives 1-e^{-2s} = 2s - 2s^2 + ...
  B3      confirmed  pred_met=True  exact diploid additive WF P_fix vs Kimura at the audit's parameters
  B4      proved     pred_met=True  Moran fixation probability (1 - r^-i)/(1 - r^-M) solves the chain; M->inf gives 1 - 1/r
  C1      proved     pred_met=True  diffusion conditional neutral fixation time -4N(1-p)ln(1-p)/p; -> 4N as p -> 0
  C2      confirmed  pred_met=True  exact WF conditional neutral fixation time vs diffusion 4N
  C3      proved     pred_met=True  exact Moran conditional neutral fixation time = M(M-1) events = M-1 generations
