  D2      confirmed  pred_met=True  discrete genotype recursion matches the continuous Haldane integral to O(s)
  D3      proved     pred_met=True  Haldane arithmetic: 300 = 30/0.1; D=30 <-> p0 = e^-15 (h=1/2); single copy at N_e=1e4: D=19.8
